<view class="title">MoodHub</view>
<view class="sub">端到端加密的心情与健康记录。数据只在你设备本地解密。</view>

<view class="card">
  <input class="input" placeholder="云端用户名" data-k="username" value="{{username}}" bindinput="onInput" />
  <input class="input" placeholder="云端密码（≥6 位）" password data-k="password" value="{{password}}" bindinput="onInput" />
  <view wx:if="{{err}}" class="sub" style="color:#c0392b">{{err}}</view>
  <view class="btn" bindtap="doRegister" wx:if="{{!busy}}">注册并启用云端同步</view>
  <view class="btn ghost" bindtap="doLogin" wx:if="{{!busy}}">登录已有账户</view>
  <view class="btn" wx:if="{{busy}}">处理中…</view>
</view>

<view class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">未启用云端时，数据仅保存在本机微信存储中。</view>
